mmerce.com\n\t\t\tWe use the variants finetuned on chat.\n\t\t\tFor example, Selenium: https://www.selenium.dev/\n\t\t\thttps://docs.python.org/3/library/urllib.parse.html\n\t\t\tdeveloper.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/Events\n\t\t\tdeveloper.chrome.com/docs/extensions/reference/tabCapture\n\t\t\tzoom.us\n\t\t\tThe re-alignment was necessary since the Chrome API allows to capture only 1 screenshot per 500 ms which sometimes caused delays in screenshot capture.\n\t\t\thttps://transparency.fb.com/policies/community-standards/\n\t\t\tAvailable at: https://huggingface.co/osunlp/MindAct ActionPrediction flan-t5-xl\n\t\t\tAlso known as LLaMA-2-*b-chat-hf\n\t\t\thttps://platform.openai.com\n\t\t\thttps://www.adept.ai/\n\t\t\tA learning rate multiplier also exists, but it is unclear what the base rate and optimizers are","level":1,"path_id":"1~85","parent_section_id":null,"order_in_parent":89,"section_id":"sec-1~85"}],"citations":[{"raw_text":"Adept ACT-1 -&quot;A machine learning model that can interact with everything on your computer\n\t\t2023/08/31\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t2023\n\t\t\n\t\n\tAdept","doi":null,"arxiv_id":null,"title":null,"anchors":[]},{"raw_text":"Open-domain Conversational Question Answering with Topic Switching\n\t\t\n\t\t\tVAdlakha\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tSDhuliawala\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tKSuleman\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tHDe Vries\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tSReddy\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tTopiocqa\n\t\t\n\t\t10.1162/tacl_a_00471\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tTrans. Assoc. Comput. Linguistics\n\t\t\n\t\t\t10\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t2022","doi":"10.1162/tacl_a_00471","arxiv_id":null,"title":"Open-domain Conversational Question Answering with Topic Switching","anchors":[{"ref_id":"b1","section_path_id":"2.3","quote":"Adlakha et al. (2022)","offset":954}]},{"raw_text":"HTLM: Hyper-text Pretraining and Prompting of Language Models\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAAghajanyan\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tDOkhonko\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tMLewis\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tMJoshi\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tHXu\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tGGhosh\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tLZettlemoy